      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOTTIE DAVIES (8) has a strong record this track and trip with six wins and four placings from 13 starts. Scored by 1.5 lengths last time (22.91) in a Grade 4/5 over 400m at Dubbo. Looks a key chance on best form. PAW KITTY (7) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Temora in a handy 18.73 beating Lumeah Storm. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Likely to be in the finish. PAW YARRA (1) found some support last start but struggled into fourth (19.16), beaten 6 lengths. Finished second the start before. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Can measure up this time. PHOENIX VIOLET (4) profiles nicely here at this trip.",
